  "ingredients": [
    "240 gram fillet mignon (cut into large pieces)",
    "salt and pepper (to taste)",
    "1 tablespoon butter",
    "1 cup shredded mozzarella",
    "1/2 cup almond flour",
    "4 tablespoon liver pate"
  ],
  "instructions": [
    {
      "text": "Season your steaks with salt and pepper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-beef-wellington/#wprm-recipe-51359-step-0-0",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/keto-beef-wellington-01.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt your butter on medium-high heat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-beef-wellington/#wprm-recipe-51359-step-0-1",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/keto-beef-wellington-02.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Once your butter is melted and bubbling, place your meat gently on the pan. It should start to sizzle and sear your steak.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-beef-wellington/#wprm-recipe-51359-step-0-2",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/keto-beef-wellington-03.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn the steaks every 2-3 minutes, making sure you’ve seared each side before taking them off the heat and letting them cool completely. This is a vital step!",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-beef-wellington/#wprm-recipe-51359-step-0-3",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/keto-beef-wellington-04.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "As you let the steaks cool, heat up your mozzarella cheese in the microwave – roughly 1 minute.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-beef-wellington/#wprm-recipe-51359-step-0-4",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/keto-beef-wellington-05.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Quickly stir in your almond flour. It will form a dough as you stir.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-beef-wellington/#wprm-recipe-51359-step-0-5",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/keto-beef-wellington-06.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "While it’s still hot, place your dough on a piece of parchment paper.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-beef-wellington/#wprm-recipe-51359-step-0-6",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/keto-beef-wellington-07.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place another piece of parchment paper on top of the dough and use a rolling pin to make the dough flat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-beef-wellington/#wprm-recipe-51359-step-0-7",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/keto-beef-wellington-08.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place some of the liver pate onto the dough, in a spot big enough for one piece of meat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-beef-wellington/#wprm-recipe-51359-step-0-8",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/keto-beef-wellington-10.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cut out the dough so you are able to form a ball around the meat, with the pate inside.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-beef-wellington/#wprm-recipe-51359-step-0-9",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/keto-beef-wellington-11.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue with the rest of the dough & meat.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-beef-wellington/#wprm-recipe-51359-step-0-10",
      "imageSource": "https://www.ruled.me/wp-content/uploads/2017/09/keto-beef-wellington-13.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake at 400°F until the pastry is a golden brown color, roughly 20-30 minutes.",
      "group": "",
      "sourceUrl": "https://www.ruled.me/keto-beef-wellington/#wprm-recipe-51359-step-0-11",
      "imageSource": null
    }
  ],
